ity is of course the  appearance and several flashbacks to the  time of the clone wars when the  relationship between anakin and ahsoka  strengthened such scenes are of course  already known from the animated series  the clone wars that doesn't mean however  that some scenes couldn't be reworked in  live action format we are definitely  excited and look forward to seeing  hayden christiansen in the ahsoka series  by disney plus which will probably not  be released until 2023 significantly  earlier will be the release of the book  of boba fett series instead which isn't  the mandalorian spin-off as well fans  can expect a streaming start on december  29th 2021  in the upcoming sonic p hedgehog 2 there  will not only be a return of the  antagonist dr robotnik but also several  completely new appearances of characters  from the sonic universe among them is  not only sonic's faithful companion  tales but also the initially hostile  knuckles who at first sights with dr  robotnik since august we know that idris  alba will dub the red echidna in an  interview with screenrant a few days ago  the 49 year old brit with a distinctive  voice talked about his role as knuckles  dubbing actor albert was unable to  reveal much yet due to contractual  commitments of course but there  definitely won't be as sexy sounding  knuckles the origin of this sexy  knuckles narrative is unclear but it is  more or less a funny in joke about the  rap the domineering and stubborn  character as opposed to a serious fetish  surrounding the fictional character sexy  sounding knuckles would be out of place  in a family friendly franchise like  sonic anyway many fans reacted to albus  statement on social media with faint  outrage others can hardly imagine  knuckles not being sexy in the movie  regardless this is an interesting  discussion that will certainly have  another few highlights before the film's  release on april 8th 2022  this year was a special one for u.s  actor brandon fraser the 52 year old  went viral and dominated the topics of  social media channels for weeks this  year the reason for this was neither a  major scandal nor premature demise  instead the net community decided to  simply express their gratitude and  celebrate the likable and humble people  behind many hollywood characters in the  1990s now many fans will be happy to  know that the mummy actor will soon be  seen in a new role the dog is of the dc  comic book adaption batgirl which is  currently in production fraser is two  stars with pyromaniac villain firefly  and give batgirl a hard time she in turn  will be embodied by leslie grace while  j.k simmons also gets to return to the  role of commissioner gordon after the  justice league snyder cut there's still  very little information about the story  but is mainly about the duality of  barbara gordon and her alter ego batgirl  which she first finds out about during  the series directors adele l arby and  bilal fallout will be in charge of  directing bringing the script by birds  of prey writer christina hodson to life  the batgirl series is currently still in  production but is expected to debut on  hbo max as early as next year  the barbie doll from the us company  mattel is probably one of the best known  toys in the world no wonder then that  various movie studios have tried their  luck at several adaptions in the past  for almost two years now a live-action  adaption with margot robbie has been  under consideration after many of those  responsible have previously abandoned  the project in addition to robbie  another big hollywood star could soon  announce his involvement and that is  none other than blade runner 2049 actor  ryan gosling if deadline is to be  believed warner brothers and their  favorite gosling are already in the  final stages of contract negotiations  for the role of kim many film fans are  naturally wondering what exactly the  plot of such a film adaption could  consist of after all barbie is first and  foremost 